Hi Thorsten,

On Sun, Sep 09, 2018 at 05:00:10PM +0000, Thorsten Alteholz wrote:
> the TDM license does not seem to be compatible with DFSG.

It took me some time to find out what you mean.  Finally I've found:


inst/extdata/vita.json:        "license": "http://doi.wiley.com/10.1002/tdm_license_1.1"
inst/extdata/vita.json:        "license": "http://doi.wiley.com/10.1002/tdm_license_1.1"
inst/extdata/vita.json:        "license": "http://doi.wiley.com/10.1002/tdm_license_1.1"
